#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:1
msgid "1 · Load the data"
msgstr "1 · Memuat data"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:3
msgid "Get a table with one row per small area into a `pandas.DataFrame`."
msgstr "Masukkan tabel dengan satu baris per area kecil ke dalam `pandas.DataFrame`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:5
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:7
msgid "A model reads four kinds of column:"
msgstr "Model membaca empat jenis kolom:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "Column"
msgstr "Kolom"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "In `data_fhnorm`"
msgstr "Di `data_fhnorm`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "Response: the direct estimate per area"
msgstr "Respons: estimasi langsung per area"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "`y`"
msgstr "`y`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "Auxiliary variables"
msgstr "Variabel penyerta"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "`x1`, `x2`, `x3`"
msgstr "`x1`, `x2`, `x3`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "Area identifier"
msgstr "Identitas area"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "`group`"
msgstr "`group`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "Survey-design columns required by the family"
msgstr "Kolom desain survei yang dibutuhkan family"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md
msgid "`D`, the sampling variance"
msgstr "`D`, varians sampling"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:16
msgid "The survey-design columns depend on the family. Gaussian needs the sampling variance, Beta needs the sample size and the design effect, and Binomial needs the number of trials."
msgstr "Kolom desain survei bergantung pada family. Gaussian membutuhkan varians sampling, Beta membutuhkan ukuran sampel dan efek desain, dan Binomial membutuhkan jumlah percobaan."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:19
msgid "Do it"
msgstr "Kerjakan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:21
msgid "Load a bundled dataset by name:"
msgstr "Muat dataset bawaan berdasarkan namanya:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:36
msgid "Two lists name the bundled datasets:"
msgstr "Dua daftar memuat nama dataset bawaan:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:50
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The synthetic datasets in `AVAILABLE_DATASETS` are ready to model. The real Papua datasets in `REAL_DATASETS` load as published and need preparing first, as shown in {doc}`../tutorials/case-study-papua`."
msgstr "Dataset sintetis di `AVAILABLE_DATASETS` siap dimodelkan. Dataset Papua yang nyata di `REAL_DATASETS` dimuat apa adanya seperti yang dipublikasikan dan perlu disiapkan terlebih dahulu, seperti ditunjukkan di {doc}`../tutorials/case-study-papua`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:54
msgid "For your own data, read the file with pandas:"
msgstr "Untuk data Anda sendiri, baca berkasnya dengan pandas:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:62
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa hasilnya"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:64
msgid "Count the missing values:"
msgstr "Hitung nilai yang hilang:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:74
msgid "A row with a missing value in any column the model uses is dropped when the model is built. Real data often has some:"
msgstr "Baris yang memiliki nilai hilang di kolom mana pun yang dipakai model dibuang saat model dibangun. Data nyata sering memilikinya:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:86
msgid "The synthetic datasets also contain the values used to generate them, such as `theta_true` and `u`. Use them only to check estimates against the truth, never as auxiliary variables."
msgstr "Dataset sintetis juga memuat nilai yang dipakai untuk membangkitkannya, seperti `theta_true` dan `u`. Gunakan hanya untuk membandingkan estimasi dengan nilai sebenarnya, jangan pernah sebagai variabel penyerta."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:89
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Jika gagal"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:91
msgid "**The dataset name is unknown.** The message lists every valid name:"
msgstr "**Nama dataset tidak dikenal.** Pesannya mencantumkan semua nama yang valid:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:104
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**An area spans several rows.** hbsaemp models area-level data. Aggregate unit-level records to one row per area first, for example with `df.groupby(...)`. Otherwise {doc}`09-estimate-areas` returns one row per observation and logs a warning."
msgstr "**Satu area tersebar di beberapa baris.** hbsaemp memodelkan data tingkat area. Agregasikan dulu catatan tingkat unit menjadi satu baris per area, misalnya dengan `df.groupby(...)`. Jika tidak, {doc}`09-estimate-areas` menghasilkan satu baris per observasi dan mencatat peringatan."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:108
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Terkait"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/01-load-data.md:110
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Every column of every bundled dataset is described in {doc}`../reference/datasets`."
msgstr "Setiap kolom dari setiap dataset bawaan dijelaskan di {doc}`../reference/datasets`."

